<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="fr">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>NewStreet Roleplay</title>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Poppins:wght@300;400;600;700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <style>
        * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; font-family: 'Poppins', sans-serif; }
        body { background-color: #0b0f19; color: #ffffff; min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column; justify-content: space-between; overflow-x: hidden; }

        /* Header avec ta vraie bannière Discord en arrière-plan */
        .hero-header {
            position: relative;
            height: 45vh;
            width: 100%;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            justify-content: center;
            align-items: center;
            overflow: hidden;
            border-bottom: 2px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3);
        }

        .hero-bg {
            position: absolute;
            top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; height: 100%;
            background-image: url('https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1531037885145550918/1531044082376511602/IMG_2079.png?ex=6a67c76a&is=6a6675ea&hm=956b149baa492c3d3c36fee3b6a2493c8fc17e6cda6f3d965a84d8246e4e979a&=&format=webp&quality=lossless');
            background-size: cover;
            background-position: center;
            z-index: 1;
            filter: brightness(0.7);
        }

        .hero-content {
            position: relative;
            z-index: 10;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
        }

        /* Ton logo rond avec son effet lumineux */
        .server-logo {
            width: 120px;
            height: 120px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            object-fit: cover;
            border: 3px solid #8b5cf6;
            box-shadow: 0 0 30px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.6);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
            animation: floatLogo 3s infinite ease-in-out;
            background: #111827;
        }

        @keyframes floatLogo {
            0%, 100% { transform: translateY(0); }
            50% { transform: translateY(-8px); }
        }

        h1 {
            font-size: 45px;
            font-weight: 700;
            letter-spacing: 2px;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, #ffffff, #a78bfa);
            -webkit-background-clip: text;
            -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;
            text-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        /* Corps de la page */
        .main-container {
            flex: 1;
            display: flex;
            flex-direction: column;
            align-items: center;
            justify-content: center;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        p { color: #9ca3af; font-size: 18px; max-width: 600px; margin-bottom: 35px; line-height: 1.6; }

        .buttons-group { display: flex; gap: 20px; flex-wrap: wrap; justify-content: center; }
        .btn { padding: 14px 32px; border-radius: 10px; font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; transition: all 0.3s ease; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 4px 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.3); }
        .btn-primary { background: linear-gradient(135deg, #8b5cf6, #6d28d9); color: white; border: none; }
        .btn-primary:hover { transform: translateY(-3px); box-shadow: 0 6px 25px rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.4); }
        .btn-secondary { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); color: white; border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); }
        .btn-secondary:hover { background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); transform: translateY(-3px); }

        footer { padding: 25px; text-align: center; color: #6b7280; font-size: 14px; border-top: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <div class="hero-header">
        <!-- Bannière Discord en fond -->
        <div class="hero-bg"></div>
        <div class="hero-content">
            <!-- Logo Discord -->
            <img src="https://media.discordapp.net/attachments/1531037885145550918/1531044081747230830/Logo_Fivem_N.png?ex=6a67c76a&is=6a6675ea&hm=692140dcde62bd6e8dad05a69b7a8bb750a15266e7aa4d00749a3830e6ac4ada&=&format=webp&quality=lossless&width=1216&height=1216" alt="NewStreet Logo" class="server-logo">
            <h1>NewStreet Roleplay</h1>
        </div>
    </div>

    <div class="main-container">
        <p>Plonge dans une expérience de jeu unique. Rejoins notre communauté, découvre nos nouveautés et lance ton aventure dès maintenant.</p>
        
        <div class="buttons-group">
            <a href="/recrutement" class="btn btn-primary">Accéder aux recrutements</a>
            <a href="https://discord.gg/newstreetrp" target="_blank" class="btn btn-secondary">Rejoindre le Discord</a>
        </div>
    </div>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 NewStreet Roleplay. Tous droits réservés.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
